OL,3,GNEWSA'Perfect site' for new high school
OL,4,Ais up for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors say land being sold by
OL,7,FWorcestershire County Council could
OL,8,Fprovide a location for a new secondary
OL,9,Fschool.
OL,11,FThe 18-acre plot on the edge of
OL,12,FWorcester is up for sale as part of
OL,13,Fplans to build 1,000 new homes, a
OL,14,Frailway station, a primary school and
OL,15,Fshops in Rushwick.
OL,17,FCouncillors say the land would be a
OL,18,Fgood location for a school after the
OL,19,Fauthority stopped working on a separate
OL,20,Fproject off Newtown Road.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
