OL,3,GNEWSA'Perfect site' for new high school
OL,4,Ais up for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Dan Boatright-Greene, Liberal
OL,7,FDemocrat cabinet member for education,
OL,8,Fsaid building a new school would
OL,9,Finvolve borrowing and grant funding
OL,10,Fthat could "risk jeopardising" the rest
OL,11,Fof the county.
